  ('53712123-08f3-5120-adac-073c06281a81'::uuid, '51825d35-cdb2-40fa-ab89-1625161b04af', 'Ajani Steadfast', 'https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/5/1/51825d35-cdb2-40fa-ab89-1625161b04af.jpg', '{3}{W}', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Ajani', ARRAY['W']::text[], ARRAY['W']::text[], '[+1]: Until end of turn, up to one target creature gets +1/+1 and gains first strike, vigilance, and lifelink.
